---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Partnership Brief"
  description="A concise introduction to Visio Nova Mundi CIC, its collaboration areas, current programme position and contact details."
>
  <article class="partnership-brief">
    <header class="brief-intro">
      <p class="brief-date">Partnership brief · 6 September 2026</p>
      <h1>Visio Nova Mundi CIC</h1>
      <p class="brief-lead">A London-based social innovation organisation developing research, community programmes and practical approaches to improving services.</p>
    </header>

    <section aria-labelledby="collaborate-title">
      <h2 id="collaborate-title">Ways to collaborate</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Research and evaluation:</strong> needs, service processes and recommendations.</li>
        <li><strong>Pilot design:</strong> feasibility, partner responsibilities and readiness.</li>
        <li><strong>Impact measurement:</strong> outcome frameworks and evidence plans.</li>
        <li><strong>Advisory and capacity building:</strong> workshops, action plans and implementation support.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="programme-title">
      <h2 id="programme-title">Current programme position</h2>
      <p>Unity House has a council-awarded six-session pilot in South Waltham Forest within the September 2026–March 2027 grant period. No permanent centre, public waste-collection service or full food-surplus operation is operating. Circular Justice remains a discovery-stage concept.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="discussion-title">
      <h2 id="discussion-title">What helps an initial discussion</h2>
      <p>Describe your organisation or community, the challenge, the support you need, existing evidence and any timing constraints. Scope, responsibilities, costs and delivery dates are agreed before an engagement begins.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="accountability-title">
      <h2 id="accountability-title">Accountability</h2>
      <p>Company number 16947678. <a href="https://find-and-update.company-information.service.gov.uk/company/16947678">Official company record</a>. Independent ventures featured in Tree of Life retain separate ownership and responsibilities.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="brief-contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
      <h2 id="contact-title">Contact</h2>
      <p><a href="mailto:visionovamundi@outlook.com">visionovamundi@outlook.com</a>. Please send a brief written enquiry without confidential or sensitive data.</p>
    </section>
  </article>

  <style>
    .partnership-brief {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .brief-intro {
      padding: 7px 0 26px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .brief-date {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      color: #0f766e;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: .08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 11px;
      font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 48px);
      line-height: 1.1;
      letter-spacing: -.035em;
    }

    .brief-lead {
      max-width: 68ch;
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.75;
    }

    section { margin-top: 24px; }
    h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 21px; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
    section p, li { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.75; }
    section p { margin: 0; }
    ul { display: grid; gap: 7px; margin: 0; padding-left: 21px; }
    li::marker { color: #0f766e; }
    strong { color: var(--text); }
    a { color: #1d4ed8; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
    .brief-contact { padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }

    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .brief-intro { padding-top: 0; }
      .brief-lead { font-size: 16px; }
      section { margin-top: 21px; }
      h2 { font-size: 19px; }
    }

    @media print {
      .partnership-brief { max-width: none; }
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
